  "story": {
    "day": 114,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Day and Happy Memory",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya woke up early on February fourth, two thousand twenty-two.",
      "She got out of bed and stretched in her bedroom.",
      "She brushed her teeth, but had a small headache.",
      "After bread and salad, she drank water in the dining room.",
      "Kaya went to her class; forty students were there.",
      "Mrs. Tanaka arrived loudly, \"We cannot wait for today!\"",
      "The day before yesterday, Kaya visited a circus in South Town.",
      "She took a photo of a band playing around a plant outside.",
      "She heard laughter and did not feel lonely by the pool.",
      "She remembered swimming and enjoying iced tea and chocolate on her break.",
      "She decided to volunteer at the front court next week.",
      "Kaya felt sure she could help build a better world."
    ]
  }
}